        <div class="main-title-2">
            <h2>
                Explore ICONIC Hotel Naran Gallery -
                <span> Visual Delight in Naran's Heart</span>
            </h2>
            <p>
                Welcome to the <a href="/">ICONIC Hotel Naran</a> Gallery, your exclusive gateway to a visual journey through the heart and soul of our Naran hotel. We understand the importance of transparency, and what better way to experience a stay with us than by taking a virtual stroll through our splendid collection of hotel photos?
            </p>
            <p>
                Our gallery is a treasure trove of images that encapsulate the charm, comfort, and grandeur of ICONIC Hotel Naran. From the moment you step foot in our establishment to the serenity of your well-appointed room, our hotel photos vividly illustrate what makes us a top choice in Naran. Every click and snap was captured to immerse you in the ICONIC experience.
            </p>
